    <!--
        Tinted fills for "something needs your attention" banners. Every section that wanted one was
        inlining its own alpha-over-accent hex, so the same message read a slightly different colour
        depending on which page you were on. The alpha is deliberately low: these sit over the page
        gradient, and the border plus the text already carry the accent - the fill only has to lift
        the block off the background enough to read as one unit.
    -->
